{"_type":"issue","id":"med-j2b.3","title":"Implement docs/plans/2026-07-06-cloud-c2e-vault-export-import.md (C2e full-vault export/import)","description":"Implement docs/plans/2026-07-06-cloud-c2e-vault-export-import.md — C2e: full-vault export/import in BOTH modes (bot + cloud), closing the C2 series with the no-lock-in guarantee.\n\nWhy one task, not export/import separately: the plan's acceptance contract is the round trip (bot export -\u003e cloud import -\u003e cloud export -\u003e bot import == identity, pinned by a shared golden fixture in Go and Vitest), so the two halves cannot be verified independently.\n\nScope (8 plan tasks): canonical vault JSON spec + golden fixture; bot-mode GET /api/export + POST /api/import (replace-only v1, transactional wipe, MCP-coverage exemptions); vendored typage (age) + backup-crypto.js with age-CLI known-answer test; web/domain/vault.js + window.CloudVault (import lands as ONE snapshot upload); shared Settings -\u003e Import/Export UI section for both modes; cross-implementation round-trip contract; docs.\n\nKey locked decisions (see plan + docs/cloud-mode.md 'Migrating an existing server-mode install'): no CLI; optional passphrase encryption via age scrypt, browser-side in both modes, server never sees passphrase; import flows through domain semantics; deterministic recordId re-minting so imports converge with live devices via LWW.","acceptance_criteria":"go test ./... and pnpm test green incl. round-trip fixture pins on both sides; manual rig pass per plan's 'Verify acceptance criteria' task (bot export imports into cloud account, .age file decrypts with reference age CLI)","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"korjavin@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-07-06T09:17:21Z","created_by":"Korzhavin Ivan","updated_at":"2026-07-06T09:17:21Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"med-j2b.3","depends_on_id":"med-j2b","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:17:21Z","created_by":"Korzhavin Ivan","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
